[{"title":"题金耑居为陈羽伯画竹居图次张观复先生韵","author":"龚诩","text":"明月清风境界宽，不栽凡卉只琅玕。\n庭除剩有三湘意，枕簟能无六月寒。\n时见啄苔来缟鹤，每惊拂石舞青鸾。\n故人诗画俱清绝，可得频过一借看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48969,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居即事","author":"龚诩","text":"幽居景物自清妍，入眼经心事事便。\n暑气渐消秋近候，凉风欲动雨馀天。\n庭除千叶舒红槿，盆盎双头吐白莲。\n更有芭蕉尤可爱，最宜濡墨写长篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48970,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与袁葛二兄泛舟至娄东","author":"龚诩","text":"风满孤篷雨洒窗，故人同载下娄江。\n绿畴南北连千亩，白鸟高低去一双。\n浊酒任斟那计数，野歌随意不论腔。\n纪行岂是无新作，正愧曹鄫浅陋邦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48971,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫成 其一","author":"龚诩","text":"远慕渊明自把锄，从渠儿辈笑迂夫。\n生怜花鸟如儿女，酷爱溪山似画图。\n不饮幸然无酒债，好吟长自负诗逋。\n年来尚觉疏狂在，折简应知未易呼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48972,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫成 其二","author":"龚诩","text":"侯门深锁曳长裾，相府尤惭进谒书。\n破瓮有齑聊当肉，直钩无饵岂图鱼。\n清风皓月终归我，紫绶金章总付渠。\n谩喜工师求大木，不曾回顾道旁樗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48973,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫成 其三","author":"龚诩","text":"自爱閒居雅趣多，不容尘土涴松萝。\n幽深彷佛元公洞，安乐依稀邵子窝。\n或武或文烧药火，非商非徵采樵歌。\n年来久息趣炎梦，冷笑飘飘赴烛蛾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48974,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田家苦楚吟","author":"龚诩","text":"极目滔滔水横流，不分高垄及低畴。\n往来客子嗟无路，刈穫农夫恨乏舟。\n爨下鲤鱼闻拨刺，枕边鸥鹭见沈浮。\n官家不信民风苦，方拟腾书贺有秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48975,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宁亲堂为阙是赋","author":"龚诩","text":"事亲常欲使亲安，羡子能行世所难。\n既失形声求视听，更于服食谨暄寒。\n设令贻辱牲牢养，争似无忧菽水欢。\n棠棣有诗昭古训，更须同气好相看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48976,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭金县丞","author":"龚诩","text":"患难归来仅两春，少闻官长爱斯民。\n适逢被水连三岁，始见忧时只一人。\n正是群黎交颂德，如何二竖遽亡身。\n老夫虽未沾私惠，公论难忘泪满巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48977,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"并渔图","author":"龚诩","text":"方舟何处两渔翁，满眼溪山乐趣同。\n得失总归谈笑里，功名都付等閒中。\n鬓毛不是缘愁白，面色常因醉酒红。\n去住问渠谁得似，行云流水任西东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48978,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪行","author":"龚诩","text":"一溪沓沓通潮汐，两岸萧萧响荻芦。\n水鸟傍人来复去，山岚入座有还无。\n夷犹鲁望烟波棹，黯淡元晖水墨图。\n对此不胜怀感慨，便宜拂袖老江湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48979,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和屈寓庵写愁韵","author":"龚诩","text":"底事中宵梦不成，一身无那万愁并。\n飘零踪迹随蓬转，澹泊生涯费舌耕。\n短蜡烧残寒漏永，慈乌啼断月华明。\n年来多少伤心恨，都付梅花晓角声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48980,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"屈季恒挽诗","author":"龚诩","text":"东吴南越久暌离，凶闻传来尚可疑。\n一死果符沈海梦，此生无复到家时。\n季方忽动元方哭，管仲空怜鲍叔知。\n最是数行题壁字，一番吟咏一伤悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48981,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中有作","author":"龚诩","text":"杨城湖口暂经过，沽酒无钱可奈何。\n白水煮鱼嫌味淡，湿薪炊饭苦烟多。\n落帆且入三叉港，脱险方离万顷波。\n东望小桥烟柳外，喜闻渔父一声歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48982,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄沈诚学","author":"龚诩","text":"黄童白叟真吾徒，田园荒芜身自锄。\n不知黑发变华发，谁问今吾非故吾。\n时逢知己话半日，每对好山倾一壶。\n世间万事不足道，醉乡即是神仙都。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48983,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登虞山寄朱孟祺","author":"龚诩","text":"此日虞山试一登，四观佳致翠层层。\n近城市店多沽酒，傍水人家半下罾。\n红叶几村秋老树，白头何处晚归僧。\n分明一段江南意，借问王维画未曾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48984,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"亡内女兄徐氏哀挽","author":"龚诩","text":"一从夫死誓终天，甘守贫寒八十年。\n名姓自期书太史，风声未肯让前贤。\n苦心只有孤灯识，清梦惟凭独鹤怜。\n如此正宜为世表，不蒙旌异为无钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48985,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芝塘道中即事","author":"龚诩","text":"北望宝芝三十里，村墟六月雨馀天。\n一湾流水一湾竹，两岸垂杨两岸蝉。\n谢老久荒先世宅，平章犹记古时田。\n浮生始悟真如梦，一度经过一怆然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48986,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王氏玉立亭诗","author":"龚诩","text":"爱君玉立亭子好，三世传来今百年。\n挺挺尚存先气槩，依依不改旧云烟。\n并当恭敬三槐树，独任文章老铁仙。\n今日我来重醉酒，不胜瞻仰叹前贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48987,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送冯翼夫广文先生分题得鲁桥瞻岱","author":"龚诩","text":"一肩行李惟书剑，北上神州道路长。\n迤?渡沂遵鲁望，迢遥仰岳辨齐疆。\n濛濛欲雨春云重，郁郁凌霄晚岱苍。\n便好举身登绝顶，晓看红日浴扶桑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48988,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马鞍山下陈氏故园","author":"龚诩","text":"主翁久作黄泉客，后事无闻继者谁。\n奇石总为他有物，翠萍空涸旧存池。\n野花蜂蝶春游处，荒草牛羊晓牧时。\n念昔经营良不易，山灵应笑世人痴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48989,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归自娄东寄张文翔","author":"龚诩","text":"忆昨访君娄水曲，轻风寒食小桃开。\n形容客况凭诗句，消遣春愁藉酒杯。\n白发千茎虽似雪，丹心一寸未成灰。\n交游独有君知我，都付无言一笑回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48990,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒家况味诗三首 其一","author":"龚诩","text":"迷途役役可哀怜，谁悟膏明取自煎。\n花为可簪遭屈折，草因无用得新鲜。\n分无求外时时乐，物不贪奇种种便。\n从此闭门甘寂寞，一囊羞涩任无钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48991,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒家况味诗三首 其二","author":"龚诩","text":"人道先生贫可怜，先生自幸省忧煎。\n诗无俗气篇篇好，菊有清香朵朵鲜。\n尚友古人诚我志，折腰儿辈岂吾便。\n老妻莫管瓶无粟，自有韩康卖药钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48992,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒家况味诗三首 其三","author":"龚诩","text":"辛勤种植本堪怜，齿为辛勤易恼煎。\n瓜瓠及时肥更好，芥菘得雨嫩而鲜。\n传家枯淡一生乐，随分羹蔬四季便。\n说与儿孙休羡肉，阿翁囊里素无钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48993,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"种园有感","author":"龚诩","text":"忆昔经营始，年华已觉衰。\n众人皆笑晚，独我不嫌迟。\n橘记移根处，梅思种核时。\n竹松培得所，桃李值随宜。\n夏恐蒿莱没，冬忧霜霰欺。\n备乾深积水，防践密编篱。\n不惮挥锄倦，宁知抱瓮疲。\n愿为经久计，耻作苟安期。\n已见花盈树，行看子满枝。\n乃知功既至，自有效相随。\n助也徒为害，忘之亦可悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48994,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归自琴川哀义孙","author":"龚诩","text":"谁信八旬之老，反哀十岁之孙。\n最苦归来元亮，稚子无人候门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48995,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"龚诩","text":"千尺虬形矫矫，四时翠色苍苍。\n但见气雄林壑，不知饱阅风霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48996,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田家词 其一","author":"龚诩","text":"积丝方满寸，累尺渐成端。\n持入公门里，何人著眼看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48997,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田家词 其二","author":"龚诩","text":"有女年方长，其如家食贫。\n鬻为豪右妾，不得嫁比邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48998,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田家词 其三","author":"龚诩","text":"烈日晒皮肤，皮肤似漆乌。\n郎君矜白面，应笑种田夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48999,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田家词 其四","author":"龚诩","text":"种田良不易，尽力费耕锄。\n入囷方为有，在田犹是无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49000,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田家词 其五","author":"龚诩","text":"县吏打门急，闻声心胆寒。\n受荆因脱裤，露出去年瘢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49001,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田家词 其六","author":"龚诩","text":"举网秋江上，鲜鳞尺许长。\n丁宁莫轻食，留荐里胥觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49002,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伤田家 其一","author":"龚诩","text":"布谷催春种，南村又北村。\n可怜逃窜尽，能得几家存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49003,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伤田家 其二","author":"龚诩","text":"布谷催春种，千声复万声。\n一身无托处，安敢话归耕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49004,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南园十咏为南野先生赋 其一 红药翻阶","author":"龚诩","text":"娇态殿馀春，芳名艳花谱。\n樽酒暖风前，僛僛为君舞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49005,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南园十咏为南野先生赋 其二 碧梧夜月","author":"龚诩","text":"清晖流玉宇，繁阴覆金井。\n露警鹤鸣馀，先生酒初醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49006,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈蒙允德东庄八景 其一 悠然处","author":"龚诩","text":"采菊见南山，佳兴与心会。\n渊明千载馀，高情付吾辈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49007,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈蒙允德东庄八景 其二 秋水亭","author":"龚诩","text":"碧水涵秋空，幽花映奇树。\n茅亭四面开，是侬钓游处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49008,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈蒙允德东庄八景 其三 清风径","author":"龚诩","text":"自别东庄来，岁月易成久。\n披图怀此君，清风想依旧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192f