1baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小画二首 其二","author":"龚诩","text":"山中无俗事，林下有閒人。\n我亦无媒者，归来愿卜邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49016,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画竹","author":"龚诩","text":"渴虬迸石出，下饮清冷湍。\n想当挥洒处，逸兴满毫端。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49017,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画梅月寄淮阴陆仲孚兼柬杜可平","author":"龚诩","text":"江夜月微明，梅花瘦影横。\n念君千里外，多少岁寒情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49018,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题双鹊图","author":"龚诩","text":"道人心已静，得失久忘情。\n寄语枝头鹊，无劳送喜声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49019,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画小景","author":"龚诩","text":"古木昼阴阴，山高流水深。\n翠苔磐石上，谁识坐来心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49020,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中思亲 其一","author":"龚诩","text":"才看黄落梧间叶，又见青归柳上枝。\n慈母鬓毛纷似雪，小儿方寸乱如丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":49021,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中思亲 其二","author":"龚诩","text":"江山不阻还家梦，笔札难穷感旧愁。\n回首北堂心最切，可怜无计买归舟